<<~ ahu slot=`#/the-ruling-under-test`>>

!! The ruling under test (controller, 2026-11-07, decided in-house)
The face delegation lease RETIRES. Every authority reader replaces its epoch freshness check (signed edge `boundEpoch` vs `expectedEpoch`; the face reader's counted lease advances floored at the sealed anchor) with anchor-pinned persona lineage plus remove-wins standing (set-aside / kāpae per edge). The fleet-wide one-shot invalidation by epoch roll is accepted as lost: it assumes every island hears the roll (a global now); whole-fleet removal stands instead as remove-wins set-asides over each edge, a kāpae over the face, or the K18 re-anchor. No back-compat: epoch fields and the roll command burn.

<<~/ahu>>

